Work at the common smooth reduction

```text
(11, gamma - 3)
```

of the terminal B89 member. Order the B103 relative-residue basis as

```text
H20(248), H11(1013), H02(248).
```

Let `C_section = F_G3BI - F_B89` be the exact 19-term correction direction
selected in G3BI and compiled in G3BK. Exactly 18 of its terms survive at this
reduction. The three residue-derivative source streams are

```text
-3 P s C_section,  P in H20,
-4 P s C_section,  P in H11,
-5 P s C_section,  P in H02.
